"Eldrin Power": {
  "index": -100,
  "category": "eldrin_altar",
  "tier": 2,
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Eldrin Power"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Much like the six "
        },
        {
          "text": "Affinities",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " that a wizard gains as they cast spells throughout their journey, there are six primal forms of power cascading throughout the world: "
        },
        {
          "text": "Arcane, Ender, Earth, Wind, Fire, and Water",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". These six powers are collectively known as "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Power",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Power",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " is used for several tasks, such as powering several Wizard Lab apparatus like the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Thesis Desk",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Disenchanter",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", or "
        },
        {
          "text": "Affinity Tinker",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Once obtained, "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Power",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " can be checked within the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Occulus",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nYou can only obtain "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Power",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " by burning "
        },
        {
          "text": "motes or sachets",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " in an "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Fume Filter",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". The generation rate is slow but steady, and requires consumables.\n\nLater, you will be able to find "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Wellsprings",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", fonts of magic where a particular affinity is extremely strong. Capturing these wellsprings will provide you with a "
        },
        {
          "text": "multiplier to Eldrin Power generated from burning things in a Fume Filter",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", increasing efficiency."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
